              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kaitlyn"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was delicious! I'm not sure I'd eat it with a spoon but it was really good on toast! The only thing keeping this from a five star is the time. It took a while to make and made a bit of a mess. I recommend it, but I wouldn't make it very often.",
